 color:#222;\">1.Withdrawal and Retirement Claim Form (Attach) To be complete and signed by HR</p><p style=\"margin-top:0; margin-bottom:12px; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#222;\">2. Basic Withdrawal Consent Form (Attach) (to be signed by the member)? The member must ensure that all personal information (address, contact number, tax number, and bank details) is accurate. If any information is incorrect, please make corrections directly on the form. No claims will be submitted with outstanding information.</p><br /><p style=\"margin-top:0; margin-bottom:12px; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#222;\">Required Supporting Documents:</p><p style=\"margin-top:0; margin-bottom:12px; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#222;\">(Please attached the required documents with the Consent Form)</p><p style=\"margin-top:0; margin-bottom:12px; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#222;\">•	Bank Statement (in member own name)</p><p style=\"margin-top:0; margin-bottom:12px; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#222;\">•	Copy of Member ID</p><p style=\"margin-top:0; margin-bottom:12px; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#222;\">•	SARS Letter (Notice of Registration showing your full name, ID number, and tax reference number)</p><p style=\"margin-top:0; margin-bottom:12px; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#222;\">•	Marriage certificate (if applicable)NB: Where there is a difference in surname between the bank statement and the identification document, a marriage certificate must be attached for verification.</p><br /><p style=\"margin-top:0; margin-bottom:12px; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#222;\">All documents MUST be returned to acvv@futurasa.co.za for electronic submission of all claims.</p><p style=\"margin-top:0; margin-bottom:12px; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#222;\">No claims will be accepted if the claim is submitted by a member or advisor directly to Sanlam.</p><br /><p style=\"margin-top:0; margin-bottom:12px; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#222;\">Important Notes:</p><p style=\"margin-top:0; margin-bottom:12px; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#222;\">•	The Vested Pot and Emergency Pot (if applicable) will be paid out separately.</p><p style=\"margin-top:0; margin-bottom:12px; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#222;\">•	Any amount in the Retirement Pot will remain in the Sanlam Unity Umbrella Pension Fund unless you provide instruction to transfer it to another approved pension fund.</p><p style=\"margin-top:0; margin-bottom:12px; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#222;\">The Basic Consent Form will indicate:</p><p style=\"margin-top:0; margin-bottom:12px; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#222;\">•	The portion that can be taken in cash</p><p style=\"margin-top:0; margin-bottom:12px; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#222;\">•	The portion that must be preserved</p><br /><p style=\"margin-top:0; margin-bottom:12px; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#222;\">Please inform the member to consult with their Financial Advisor for completion of options on the form if needed.</p><br /><p style=\"margin-top:0; margin-bottom:12px; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#222;\">Please note that any fund with missing information, including outstanding claim forms, is recorded as non-compliant in the FSCA’s records.</p><br /><p style=\"margin-top:0; margin-bottom:12px; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#222;\">Your urgent attention to this matter is required to ensure that the fund remains compliant with regulatory requirements.</p><br /><p style=\"margin-top:0; margin-bottom:12px; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#222;\">Regards</p></div><br><br><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #333; margin-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid #ccc; padding-top: 10px;\">\n    \n    <!-- DYNAMIC AGENT 