,NULL,NULL,'2026-11-21 11:35:50.000000','<html><head>\r\n<meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\"><meta name=\"Generator\" content=\"Microsoft Word 15 (filtered medium)\"><style>\r\n<!--\r\n@font-face\r\n	{font-family:\"Cambria Math\"}\r\n@font-face\r\n	{font-family:Calibri}\r\n@font-face\r\n	{font-family:Verdana}\r\np.MsoNormal, li.MsoNormal, div.MsoNormal\r\n	{margin:0cm;\r\n	margin-bottom:.0001pt;\r\n	font-size:11.0pt;\r\n	font-family:\"Calibri\",sans-serif}\r\na:link, span.MsoHyperlink\r\n	{color:blue;\r\n	text-decoration:underline}\r\na:visited, span.MsoHyperlinkFollowed\r\n	{color:purple;\r\n	text-decoration:underline}\r\np.MsoListParagraph, li.MsoListParagraph, div.MsoListParagraph\r\n	{margin-top:0cm;\r\n	margin-right:0cm;\r\n	margin-bottom:0cm;\r\n	margin-left:36.0pt;\r\n	margin-bottom:.0001pt;\r\n	font-size:11.0pt;\r\n	font-family:\"Calibri\",sans-serif}\r\np.msonormal0, li.msonormal0, div.msonormal0\r\n	{margin-right:0cm;\r\n	margin-left:0cm;\r\n	font-size:11.0pt;\r\n	font-family:\"Calibri\",sans-serif}\r\nspan.EmailStyle19\r\n	{font-family:\"Calibri\",sans-serif;\r\n	color:windowtext}\r\nspan.EmailStyle23\r\n	{font-family:\"Calibri\",sans-serif;\r\n	color:windowtext}\r\n.MsoChpDefault\r\n	{font-size:10.0pt}\r\n@page WordSection1\r\n	{margin:72.0pt 72.0pt 72.0pt 72.0pt}\r\ndiv.WordSection1\r\n	{}\r\nol\r\n	{margin-bottom:0cm}\r\nul\r\n	{margin-bottom:0cm}\r\n-->\r\n</style></head><body lang=\"AF\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\"><div class=\"WordSection1\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">Beste Lucia, </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">Soos versoek, hoor ek graag van jou aangaande die onderstaande bevestiging asseblief, waarna ek die vorm kan onderteken.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">Groete,</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">Liezel</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p><div><div style=\"border:none; border-top:solid #E1E1E1 1.0pt; padding:3.0pt 0cm 0cm 0cm\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\">From:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\"> liezel@acvv.org.za &lt;liezel@acvv.org.za&gt; <br><b>Sent:</b> Tuesday, 17 November 2026 17:06<br><b>To:</b> \'Lucia Smuts\' &lt;lcsmuts@gmail.com&gt;<br><b>Cc:</b> \'Belinda Mostert (Voorsitter)\' &lt;voorsitter@acvv.org.za&gt;<br><b>Subject:</b> RE: FW: Lucia vorm vir teken deur werkgewer</span></p></div></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">Beste Lucia,</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">Ek bevestig dat ek die vorm ontvang het en onderteken dit graag soos deur jou versoek. </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">Die volgende word aangedui t.o.v. die werkgewer se onderneming by die ondertekening van die dokument:</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\"><img width=\"982\" height=\"224\" id=\"Picture_x0020_1\" src=\"/attachments/local/3/\" style=\"width:10.2333in; height:2.3333in\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">Ter wille van deeglikheid, versoek ek graag die volgende, aangesien ek ter bevestiging hiervan moet teken.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p><ol start=\"1\" type=\"1\" style=\"margin-top:0cm\"><li class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0cm\"><span style=\"\">Sal jy asb aan my bevestig dat al die inligting in die dokument korrek is – ook jou bankbesonderhede. </span></li></ol><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p><ol start=\"2\" type=\"1\" style=\"margin-top:0cm\"><li class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0cm\"><span style=\"\">Asook, dat dit jou handtekening in die dokument is.</span></li></ol><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p><ol start=\"3\" type=\"1\" style=\"margin-top:0cm\"><li class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0cm\"><span style=\"\">Laastens, ook dat al die opsies in terme van die “Rules of the Fund” volledig aan jou verduidelik was?</span></li></ol><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">Ek verneem graag van jou in die verband.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">Vriendelike groete, </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">Liezel</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\">From:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\"> Lucia Smuts &lt;<a href=\"mailto:lcsmuts@gmail.com\">lcsmuts@gmail.com</a>&gt; <br><b>Sent:</b> Tuesday, 17 November 2026 13:51<br><b>To:</b> <a href=\"mailto:liezel@acvv.org.za\">liezel@acvv.org.za</a><br><b>Subject:</b> Fwd: FW: Lucia vorm vir teken deur werkgewer</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Liezel</p><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Sien onderstaande terugvoer van \'n vorm wat werkgewer nog moet teken.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p></div><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\">dankie.</p><div><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\">---------- Forwarded message ---------<br>From: <strong><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">Willem van der Merwe</span></strong> &lt;<a href=\"mailto:Willem.vanderMerwe@momentum.co.za\">Willem.vanderMerwe@momentum.co.za</a>&gt;<br>Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 at 12:27<br>Subject: FW: Lucia vorm vir teken deur werkgewer<br>To: Lucia Smuts &lt;<a href=\"mailto:lcsmuts@gmail.com\">lcsmuts@gmail.com</a>&gt;</p></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p><div><div><div><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span lang=\"EN-ZA\">Sanlam het laat weet die jou werkgewer moet ook net die vorm ook teken asb. Sakina het die hele dokument netso vir Sanlam gestuur, sonder dat jou werkgewer geteken het. Net laaste bl (section D) met datum.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span lang=\"EN-ZA\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span lang=\"EN-ZA\">Mooi bly.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span lang=\"EN-ZA\">Willem</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span lang=\"EN-ZA\">&nbsp;</span></p><div><div><div><table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"650\" style=\"width:487.5pt\"><tbody><tr><td width=\"148\" style=\"width:111.0pt; padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><img border=\"0\" width=\"147\" height=\"200\" id=\"_x0000_i1026\" src=\"/attachments/local/4/\" style=\"width:1.5333in; height:2.0833in\"></p></td><td width=\"502\" valign=\"bottom\" style=\"width:376.5pt; padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm\"><table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td nowrap=\"\" style=\"padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:11.25pt\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; color:#003366\">Willem</span></strong> <strong><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; color:#003366\">Van Der Merwe</span></strong> <span style=\"font-size:9.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; color:#003366\"><br>Executive Financial Adviser</span> </p></td><td width=\"178\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:133.5pt; padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"right\" style=\"text-align:right\"><a href=\"http://mmi3.rocketseed.com/rs/a0oS8PWBtHEWdm4\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"><img border=\"0\" width=\"125\" height=\"27\" id=\"m_-3654497972824068205img3683\" src=\"/attachments/local/5/\" style=\"width:1.3in; height:.2833in\"></span></a></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm\"><table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" w